ar": "1924285d69b14cbc6372e05faddda8df6e787002"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "还可以，希望线上能用风灵月影\n", "timestamp_created": 1637637088, "timestamp_updated": 1637637088, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.417974710464477539", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103308893", "author": {"steamid": "76561198326376619", "personaname": "QAQ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198326376619/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2449, "last_played": 1639825805, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏又贵，更新又拉夸，经典pve游戏强行加游戏难度喂💩，更新还不如不更新\n从未见过如此离谱的怪物刷新机制，只要是你看不到的地方，那怕是刚转过身的房间都能刷个大高个骑脸\nRNM退钱", "timestamp_created": 1637636604, "timestamp_updated": 1637636604, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507389187812805176", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103307958", "author": {"steamid": "76561198352317111", "personaname": "VitaminC", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SMT984942058/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 1634, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 820, "last_played": 1701692164, "avatar": "91af68d968079c4797ab1ce3bb28cfa07be5d04e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "事先声明我是在2021年11月20日该游戏打7折的时候入的，也就是这个游戏在正式发布的一个月后就打了7折，价格降了将近100块\n战役内容量还行，卡牌系统带来了新的玩法，枪械后坐力表现一般，武器打击感优秀\n但是这些加起来也远远达不到一个3A游戏价格的水准，尤其体现在武器的换弹动画只有空仓换弹动画（我知道这是祖宗之法不可变）、武器子弹抛壳动画当你停止射击后就会马上消失，也就是会出现你点射看不到子弹抛壳，连射的时候突然停止射击子弹会从空中消失的画面、仅仅做了一些非常简单的特定表面的子弹命中弹孔表现，尤其是当子弹打在水里的时候甚至不会激起一点水花、人物动作单一且机械、以及战役模式有联机游玩的情况下竟不支持单机游玩\n这些显然不是我期望在一个2021年售价298人民币的游戏上能看到的情况，就跟我在这个游戏B测时候的态度一样。当然，如果这个游戏有一天永久调价到148-198之间，你们可以当作这是一条好评", "timestamp_created": 1637635056, "timestamp_updated": 1637635056, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51282048225402832", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103305114", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851156887", "personaname": "ui949", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198851156887/", "num_games_owned": 27, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2882, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2782, "last_played": 1703316690, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "为什么只有4章", "timestamp_created": 1637630485, "timestamp_updated": 1637630485, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103301714", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996659120", "personaname": "纳垢烤肉", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IS5TC/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 52, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 52, "last_played": 1637590178, "avatar": "ceb41ddb86016cf94987669afe80af8757b68b40"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这游戏不值200多。", "timestamp_created": 1637624846, "timestamp_updated": 1637624846, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 